  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Delete the LuciferValidate helper and migrate its functionality into more appropriate locations while simplifying several core APIs. Key changes:\n      - Removed src/LuciferCore/Main/LuciferValidate.cs and all direct usages; replaced SafeToInt32 calls with Buffer.SafeToInt32 and moved SafeToInt32 implementation into Buffer.\n      - Simplified FastBinary methods to expression-bodied forms and removed explicit validation calls.\n      - Trimmed FastReflection by removing many helper reflection utilities (only MakeGeneric kept) and cleaned up unused usings.\n      - Updated HandlerBase, SimulationManager and other callers to avoid LuciferValidate checks and handle nulls where appropriate.\n      - Refactored LuciferPool: simplified Rent/TryRent/Return semantics, removed some Try* helpers, added AsStruct overload using Span <byte> and adjusted debug assertions.\n      - Removed several validation calls across Utf8 and Storage code (Slice, ByteString, Utf8Builder) relying on tightened invariants or local checks.\n\nThese changes centralize the int-safety helper, reduce duplication of null/range checks, and simplify pool/reflection APIs. Review callsites for any behavioral changes due to removed validation wrappers.",
